.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
ephe/*.se1
# Exceptions: these three files ship in the Docker image instead of relying
# on pyswisseph's Moshier analytical fallback. Moshier is close enough for
# most callers (~0.1 arcsec for planets, ~3 arcsec for the Moon versus
# 0.001 arcsec with these files), but some callers read subdivisions fine
# enough that the Moshier Moon error matters: a Human Design tone spans
# 93.75 arcsec, and the Sense Variable comes from the Design Nodes tone,
# which derives from the lunar orbit, so a ~3 arcsec Moshier error can put
# a chart in the wrong tone. Chiron additionally has no Moshier fallback
# at all, so it must ship regardless.
!ephe/seas_18.se1
!ephe/sepl_18.se1
!ephe/semo_18.se1
ephe/sefstars.txt
